### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5144/tasks

###

### Create a task (Successful request with a future due date)
POST http://localhost:5144/tasks
content-type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Write another demo",
    "dueDate": "2027-12-31",
    "isCompleted": false
}

###

### Create a task (Validation test: a past due date returns 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:5144/tasks
content-type: application/json

{
    "id": 2,
    "name": "Invalid past date task",
    "dueDate": "2025-12-31",
    "isCompleted": false
}

###

### Get a specific task by its ID
GET http://localhost:5144/tasks/1

###

### Update a task completely (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5144/tasks/1
content-type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Completely updated task name",
    "dueDate": "2028-01-01",
    "isCompleted": true
}

###

### Partially update a task (PATCH - modifying the completion status only)
PATCH http://localhost:5144/tasks/1
content-type: application/json

{
    "isCompleted": false
}

###

### Delete a task by its ID
DELETE http://localhost:5144/tasks/1

###

### Rewriter URL Test (The old /tasks route will be automatically redirected to /api/todos/1)
GET http://localhost:5144/tasks/1
